请对以下 case 进行三维加权评分。

=== case_id ===
Case-08-sleep-004

=== 用户原始指令 (query.txt) ===
整个睡眠卡片，主图那种，点一下能跳到app里，要显示已连接

=== TaskSpec 契约 (task.taskSpec.json) ===
{
  "userQuery": "整个睡眠卡片，主图那种，点一下能跳到app里，要显示已连接",
  "size": "2x2",
  "eventCandidates": [
    {
      "call": "clickToDeeplink",
      "args": {
        "bundleName": "",
        "abilityName": "",
        "uri": "huaweischeme://healthapp/router/sleepDetail"
      }
    }
  ],
  "dataModelSchema": {
    "sleep": {
      "title": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "睡眠服务标题。",
        "sampleValue": "睡眠"
      },
      "connectionStatus": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "睡眠服务或设备的当前连接状态展示文本。",
        "sampleValue": "已连接"
      }
    }
  },
  "assetCandidates": [
    {
      "src": "resources/base/media/icon_sleep.png",
      "description": "睡眠监督场景的彩色睡眠图标，适合作为 2x2 睡眠卡片的主视觉图。"
    }
  ]
}

